	<div class="carousel-style2-text">
		<h2 class="carousel-style2-title" itemprop="headline">
			肋眼牛排是什麼？3分鐘教你挑選高品質肉品與完美烹調法		</h2>
		<div class="carousel-style2-meta">
		    <span class="carousel-style2-category">
		        <ul class="post-categories">
